  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Slipping back into Sapporo past his own wanted poster, Muranishi is welcomed at the shop by Kitamori. Sensing something wrong when Kitamori sweats despite the cool weather, Muranishi shouts to Toshi to run as detectives close in across Susukino. Listen to the Japanese first, then we'll go through it together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、もっといい写真あったろ、これ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おい、行くぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会長、お待ちしておりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "さあさあ、お疲れでしょう。上に部屋取ってありますんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "バカかお前、こんなとこ泊まったら目立つだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうぞ、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "北森、そんなに暑いか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "えっ、いや、何のこと？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、逃げるぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "逃げろ、おっさん！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "皆さま、札幌ツアーへようこそお越しくださいました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちゃんと見て。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、もっといい写真あったろ、これ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, surely they had a better photo than this one.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おい、行くぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, let's keep moving.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会長、お待ちしておりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairman, we have been waiting for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "さあさあ、お疲れでしょう。上に部屋取ってありますんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come right in, you must be tired. We reserved a room upstairs for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "バカかお前、こんなとこ泊まったら目立つだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you an idiot? Staying somewhere like this will stand right out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうぞ、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please, right this way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "北森、そんなに暑いか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kitamori, is it really that hot in here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "えっ、いや、何のこと？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh? No, what do you mean?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、逃げるぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Toshi, let's run!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "逃げろ、おっさん！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Run for it, old man!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "皆さま、札幌ツアーへようこそお越しくださいました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone, welcome aboard the Sapporo tour.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちゃんと見て。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Check your ticket properly.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
